@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@customerId = 1
@professionalId = 1
@serviceId = 1
@appointmentId = 1
@accessToken = paste_access_token_here

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Criar agendamento
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": {{customerId}},
  "professionalId": {{professionalId}},
  "serviceId": {{serviceId}},
  "startAt": "2030-01-20T10:00:00Z"
}

### Listar agendamentos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments?date=2030-01-20&professionalId={{professionalId}}&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Buscar agendamento por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{appointmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Testar conflito de horário
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": {{customerId}},
  "professionalId": {{professionalId}},
  "serviceId": {{serviceId}},
  "startAt": "2030-01-20T10:30:00Z"
}

### Testar intervalo sem conflito no limite exato
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": {{customerId}},
  "professionalId": {{professionalId}},
  "serviceId": {{serviceId}},
  "startAt": "2030-01-20T11:00:00Z"
}

### Observação
# Agendamentos concluídos bloqueiam a agenda até completedAt + bufferMinutes do serviço.
# Agendamentos ainda abertos continuam bloqueando até o endAt previsto.

### Remarcar agendamento
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/reschedule
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startAt": "2030-01-21T14:00:00Z"
}

### Cancelar agendamento
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cancelReason": "Cliente solicitou cancelamento."
}
